  own docstring already advertises for tests/qt; verified tonight.

  SO: `--unit=` for long HEADLESS jobs that must outlive the shell (the
  i18n builds, where it was the right call and rescued three dead runs).
  `--scope`, i.e. `run_capped.sh`, for anything that builds a
  QApplication. A plain background process works for Qt as well.

