  THE CORE DUMP WAS A REAL PRODUCT BUG and is fixed (52f3642b6): a SEGFAULT in
  `settings_model._sibling_label_for`, reached from `retarget_field_tooltips`
  <- `app_screen._translate` <- `_on_arrival`. It walks layout items and a
